	(text_box "TPS2553: ILIM 18k → 1.34–1.52 A.  EN is pulled up: DUT_5V is on\n  even with no firmware; ~FAULT flags current limit / over-temperature.\nINA226 (I2C 0x40) runs from +3V3: it measures the drop across\n  R19 (50 mΩ → 1.64 A full scale, Kelvin sense pads) and DUT_5V on Vbus.\nAUX: TX/RX through 1k, VREF = +3V3 through 10 Ω (level hint),\n  RESET/BOOT open-drain (2N7002, 100k gate pull-downs)."
